Losing some control over the player is perfect.  However there should be 
some chance to influence your movements based upon your INT and WIS. 
Especially for bad actions, such as killing your pet, smashing an altar, 
or hurling your Frost Brand at a White Dragon.

> Rages should last just a few dozen turns. Not sure how to induce them,
