> 
Following especially long rages if there is no one around following the 
battle the character should collapse and pass out for a few turns 
(perhaps sleep resistance reduces the time or eliminates it entirely).

> THere should be some kind of item (hero-harness?) to help mitigate or
> nullify the effects of a rage, and give players some limited control
